# Copy this to .env (gitignored) — read by the bridge-core deploy/smoke/canary scripts
# (deploy-generation, live-intent, verify-l1, smoke-existing-testnet, smoke-fuel-existing-testnet,
# fuel-testnet, fee-juice-canary-testnet, drip-canary-testnet, check-fpc-version). The sandbox
# (deploy:sandbox) signs with anvil's funded keys and needs only SEPOLIA_RPC_URL (it copies Permit2 +
# Multicall3 bytecode from Sepolia).

# Required for anything that signs — the generation deploy, the candidate smokes, the fuel canary. The Sepolia deployer EOA; `deploy-generation` refuses any key whose address is
# not the plan-pinned testnet signer (PLAN_PINNED_L1_SIGNERS in live-intent.ts). Never commit a
# real value; never create one for an agent.
PRIVATE_KEY=0x...

# Required by deploy-generation (and pre-create): the STABLE secret the L2 deployer account is
# derived from (>= 16 chars, network-separated by name + derivation domain). Same value on every
# re-run — losing it after funding orphans the deployer's fee juice. Store it like a key.
BRIDGE_DEPLOYER_SECRET_TESTNET=...

# Required for L1 reads/broadcasts. Scripts fall back to the public Sepolia node for reads —
# use your own endpoint for anything that broadcasts.
SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=https://...

# Required by the Sepolia fork suite FactoryFork: the network's canonical Aztec registry. Absent ⇒ it
# skips.
# AZTEC_REGISTRY=0x...

# Optional — defaults shown; uncomment to override.
# AZTEC_NODE_URL=https://lb.drpc.live/aztec-testnet/Ak_eT5HA2kbyqamqGTF702daoH37vEsR8YYxjmVXwXgc
# FORGE_BIN=forge             # only if forge is not on PATH (else PATH, then ~/.aztec/current/bin/forge)
# CAST_BIN=cast               # else ~/.aztec/current/internal-bin/cast, the 5.0.0 pin, then PATH

# Per-invocation knobs — pass them on the command line, never persist them here:
#   deploy-generation deploy   SEED_TOKENS=<erc20>,<erc20>   (the mintable test tokens to pre-create)
#   fuel-testnet               PRIVATE_RUNS=1 (settle canary only — never lowers minFuelFj)
#   live-intent                INTENT_SECOND_AZTEC_RPC (optional second endpoint for the identity probe)
#   token-list.test.ts         TOKEN_LIST_LIVE=1 (the real-origin canary)
# The full sequence is .claude/skills/bridge-generation/SKILL.md, Branch B.
